Adaptive sections below. Include ONLY when the task's complexity and the info gathered actually warrant it. Delete the ones you do not use. Do NOT add story points, components, or priority - those are out of scope. Write every paragraph here as one continuous line with no mid-paragraph newline: Jira renders each newline as a real line break, so hard-wrapping at a column width breaks formatting on paste. (Remove this line before emitting the ticket.)

h2. Context

<Key background / why. Often a grounding finding with a file:line citation.>

